# Molten Exhale at sorcery speed (CR 601.2b, 701.4a): with a Dragon in hand to behold, "Flash: behold a Dragon" is asked though
# nothing needs it (the rulings allow it). On turn 3 Bot1 beholds Kokusho, the Evening Star (revealed, and it stays in hand)
# and kills an Ornithopter; on turn 5 it declines and kills the other. Either way the cost was paid with mana alone: Mox Jet
# stays untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Kokusho, the Evening Star
Molten Exhale
Molten Exhale
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Molten Exhale.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot1.Modes(Flash:)
Bot1.Choose(Kokusho, the Evening Star)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 1
? Bot1.Hand.Kokusho, the Evening Star.Colors = Black
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Molten Exhale.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Modes(Cast without flash)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Ornithopter
Bot1.Hand.Kokusho, the Evening Star.Colors = Black
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = false
Stack.Count = 0
